## HOW TO USE
To run this cleanup script:

1. Open PowerShell and navigate to your `OrchardPups` folder.
2. Run this command to verify what will be deleted without actually deleting anything:
   ```powershell
   .\Cleanup-PastLitters.ps1 -DryRun
   ```
3. When you're ready to delete them for real:
   ```powershell
   .\Cleanup-PastLitters.ps1
   ```
   > [!NOTE]
   > Depending on your computer's security settings, you might need to run: `powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\Cleanup-PastLitters.ps1`
